      Frontend | React 19/Vite/Tailwind | frontend/
      Orchestration | Docker (app/db/redis/n8n) | docker-compose.yml
      AI/ML | OpenAI/Groq parsing | app/core/ai/, data/
      Testing | Pytest/mkdocs | tests/, scripts/

      Environment: docker-compose up (local), GitHub Actions CI.
      Entry: run.sh, /docs, localhost:3000.

      2. Current Task: [User fills this]
      Requirements: ...
      Out of scope: ...

      3. Existing State: Beta parsing (150+ fields), semantic AI, scripts/commit_and_pr.sh.
      Preserve endpoints/volumes.

      4. Constraints: Python 3.12/FastAPI 0.115/React 19, async I/O, OWASP, Redis cache <500ms, 100% test cov, Ruff/Black/mypy.
      Compat: ATS 98%, multilingual EN/NL/RU.

      5. Tools: Edit app/frontend/scripts/docker/.github/; docker/poetry/pytest/mkdocs; forbid DB direct/prod deploy.

      6. Outputs: 1.Summary (3-bullets). 2.Files (full new/diffs). 3.Tests (pytest --cov). 4.Scripts/deploy cmds. 5.Validation (black/ruff/pytest/docker up).

